Summary of the nature of the modifications (see git history for detail):
removal of telemetry, error reporting, auto update, accounts, subscriptions,
cloud sync, the hosted AI provider, the pipe store, and third party OAuth
integrations; changed defaults so that data retention is on and analytics are
off; renamed the user facing product to litepipe.
